 "item4_preprocessing_audit": {
  "standardization": "FITTED INSIDE FOLD \u2014 mean/std computed on the training rows only (_standardize(Xtr, Xte)); verified by a selftest that a test-set outlier does not move the training moments.",
  "ridge_penalty_selection": "FITTED INSIDE FOLD \u2014 chosen on an inner 80/20 split of the TRAINING window; scoring rows are never used to pick l2.",
  "coefficients": "FITTED INSIDE FOLD \u2014 every model is refit on each expanding window.",
  "imputation": "NOT FOLD-FITTED, and disclosed: missing SP K%/BB%/ERA fall back to FIXED GLOBAL CONSTANTS (LG_ERA 4.20, K 22.0, BB 8.5) and the ERA shrinkage prior is the same constant. These are PRIORS, not quantities estimated from data, so they carry no outcome information and cannot leak the future \u2014 but they are not re-estimated per fold, and a purist implementation would fit them on the training window. Materiality is small: rows with missing TEAM form are dropped outright rather than imputed.",
  "row_filtering": "Rows lacking team run data are EXCLUDED (R1: not imputed). The filter uses no outcome information.",
  "target_leakage": "None: no market price, no post-game quantity, and no same-day information enters the features; the training window is strictly date < test date."
 },
